      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-q/q10-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"He stands 3 metres from A. [A1] Taking moments about A, for centre-of-mass distance d, 200g(2) = 110g(3) + 20gd, d = 3.5 m . [M1] [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
